  "track": "KY-A Licence",
  "description": "Mirror of the Agent Passport demo mandate on the vouch rail: Northgate Joinery Ltd's three allowlisted suppliers, a GBP 10,000 per-payment cap, and one agent (Agent 247) with a spending mandate. Used by PAYMENT_RAIL=vouch to settle each ALLOWed instruction. Synthetic.",
  "program": {
